WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.275
Video 12. Journal, credit note, debit note.

00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:09.334
Journal rokad ke bank vagar ni entry nondhe
chhe.

00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:14.263
Ek ledger debit, Salary. Biju credit, Salary
Payable.

00:00:14.563 --> 00:00:17.171
V, pachhi F7: journal.

00:00:17.872 --> 00:00:21.904
Enter thi Dr. Salary, ₹40,000.

00:00:22.603 --> 00:00:27.999
C thi Cr. Salary Payable: Hisaab e j rakam
bhare chhe.

00:00:28.692 --> 00:00:32.515
Narration lakho, ane Ctrl+A thi save.

00:00:33.664 --> 00:00:37.306
Credit note: grahak maal paachho aape chhe.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:41.375
Debit note: tame supplier ne maal paachho aapo
chho.

00:00:41.675 --> 00:00:47.618
Alt+F6: credit note. Patel Garments, ane sales
ledger.

00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:52.806
Paachhi aavti item: 5 meter silk, ₹900 na
bhaave.

00:00:53.507 --> 00:01:00.038
CGST ane SGST: Hisaab tax gane chhe. Pachhi
narration.

00:01:00.737 --> 00:01:07.710
Ctrl+I, Statutory Details: kaaran, ane mool
invoice, 31 May nu number 2.

00:01:10.861 --> 00:01:17.011
Ctrl+A thi accept. Agst Ref invoice 2 maa thi
rakam ghatade chhe.

00:01:17.698 --> 00:01:19.389
Credit note save thai.

00:01:21.842 --> 00:01:27.798
Alt+F5: debit note. Mehta Fabrics, ane
purchase ledger.

00:01:28.497 --> 00:01:33.440
100 meter cotton, ₹110 na bhaave, IGST saathe.

00:01:34.141 --> 00:01:39.443
Narration, ane Statutory Details ma mool bill:
MF/101.

00:01:42.594 --> 00:01:49.817
Ctrl+A thi accept. Bill chukvelu chhe, etle
bill-wise ma New Ref.

00:01:49.847 --> 00:01:51.601
Debit note save thai.

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:57.759
Patel Garments nu devu ₹4,725 ghatyu.

00:01:57.689 --> 00:02:02.673
Mehta Fabrics have tamne ₹11,550 aapshe.

00:02:02.872 --> 00:02:05.487
Have pachhi: bank reconciliation.

